OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBlustery showers will spread
OL,6,Fsouthwards through the day with some
OL,7,Fof these heavy and wintry over high
OL,8,Fground. Some brighter spells breaking
OL,9,Fthrough between showers. Strong winds,
OL,10,Fperhaps reaching gale force around the
OL,11,Fcoasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMostly cloudy with showers
OL,14,Fcontinuing to spread southwards
OL,15,Fthrough the evening, wintry on high
OL,16,Fground. Showers easing overnight with
OL,17,Fsome clear intervals developing.
OL,18,FStronger coastal winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
