OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA mostly dry and cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith some bright or sunny intervals,
OL,7,Fthe best of these in the east. The odd
OL,8,Fshower possible near the Moray coast.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,11,Fcloudy Saturday with some showers.
OL,12,FCloudy Sunday with longer and heavier
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain which will likely
OL,14,Fcontinue into Monday before clearing
OL,15,Flater in the day. Breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
